    "## 3. 技术实现细节\n",
    "\n",
    "**文档解析器**：\n",
    "- PDF：pypdfium2（快，支持中文）+ pypdf（fallback）\n",
    "- DOCX：python-docx\n",
    "- Markdown：直接读取\n",
    "\n",
    "**Chunk 策略**：\n",
    "- RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter（分层切分）\n",
    "- 中文友好 separator：`\\n\\n` → `\\n` → `。` → `？`\n",
    "\n",
    "**嵌入模型**：\n",
    "- nomic-embed-text（通用）\n",
    "- bge-m3（中文强）\n",
    "\n",
    "**检索策略**：\n",
    "- dense retrieval（ChromaDB）\n",
    "- BM25（keyword）\n",
    "- RRF（加权融合）\n",
    "\n",
    "**API 设计**：\n",
    "- `POST /query`：RAG 查询（流式）\n",
    "- `POST /docs`：添加文档\n",
    "- `DELETE /docs/{id}`：删除文档\n",
    "- `GET /healthz`：健康检查"
